-| Permission           | Values                                                                      |
-| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
-| `edit`               | `ask` / `allow` / `deny`                                                    |
-| `bash`               | `ask` / `allow` / `deny` or per-command: `{ "git": "allow", "rm": "deny" }` |
-| `webfetch`           | `ask` / `allow` / `deny`                                                    |
-| `doom_loop`          | `ask` / `allow` / `deny`                                                    |
-| `external_directory` | `ask` / `allow` / `deny`                                                    |
