-### Provider-Specific
-
-#### Google Auth
-
-Install [`opencode-antigravity-auth`](https://github.com/NoeFabris/opencode-antigravity-auth) for Google Gemini. Provides multi-account load balancing, dual quota, and variant-based thinking.
